stacks of <color=#5d82af>Haste</color>.\u0004\u000eHASTE RECLAIM\u0014�When a <color=#ff91d2>Sprite</color> dies, you gain ({0:l} + <color=#ff91d2>Sprite</color> Max HP * {1:p}) stacks of <color=#5d82af>Haste</color>.\u0004\u000bHASTY RAGE\u0014cWhenever you enter <color=#90172f>Fury</color>, gain {0:l} stacks of <color=#5d82af>Haste</color>.\u0004\fHASTE DECAY\u0014G{1:plr} Effectiveness Reduction to enemy <color=#5d82af>Haste</color>.\u0004\u000fROYALE CRYSTAL\u0014?Used to unlock Heroes in the Gallery (available in the store).\u0004\rPREMIUM PASS\u0014_It is used to unlock the premium reward channel in the Season Handbook. (Obtained in the Mall)\u0004\u0006TAROT\u0014iUse 1 in the [Choose Hero] and [Choose Treasure] phases to refresh the options (available in the store).\u0014@Used to purchase items in the store (available via the top-up).\u0004\u0011COLLECTION SHARD\u0014^Used to exchange other items in the Collection interface. (The duplicates will be converted.)\u0004\u0011COLLECTION CHEST\u0004\rROYALE CHEST\u0004\u001eGuaranteed Item You Don't Own\u0004\bFLOWERS\u0014MA flower that can be used to support your favorite player in the tournament.\u0004\u0016TAROT MEMBERSHIP CARD\u0004\u0005ITEM\u0004\nHERO SKIN\u0004\rBATTLE Field\u0004\u000fVICTORY EFFECT\u0004\rENTER EFFECT\u0004\u0007AVATAR\u0004\u000fInfinity Chest\u0004\u000eSUMMON ALLIES\u0014= In battles, available Heroes in the [Choose Hero] phase +1.\u0004\u000fTREASURE SHELF\u0014D In battles, available Treasures in the [Choose Treasure] phase +1.\u0014wAfter purchase, you will get 30 redemption times. You can click the redemption button once a day to get 6 Tarot cards.\u0014+(Production channels: Unlocked by default)\u0004&(Acquisition method: Season Handbook)\u0004'(Acquisition method: COLLECTION CHEST)\u0004!(Acquisition method: Collection)\u0004\u001b(Acquisition method: Mall)\u00143(Acquisition method: Collection, COLLECTION CHEST)\u0004((Acquisition method: Season settlement)\u0004\"(Acquisition method: ROYALE PASS)\u0014/(Acquisition method: STORE-Limited Time Offer)\u0004\u001fChristmas Limited Edition 2024\u0004!Limited for the New Year of 2025\u0004&(Acquisition: Shop - Legendary Chest)\u0004\u0016WASTELAND BANDIT GANG\u0014nAbandon useless mercy and kindness. This is the sandstorm-ravaged wasteland, where only the toughest survive!\u0004\u0012INFERNAL SENTINEL\u0014]Boiling lava, dancing flames—someone still guards their homeland in this barren wasteland.\u0004\fROYAL DWARF\u0014\\Oh! He really looks much more formidable than ordinary dwarves. Gold is truly a fine thing!\u0004\rWAVE SAMURAI\u0014cSea mercenaries who follow the currents, said to appear anywhere on the ocean by riding the tides.\u0004\u0014TRIBAL WITCH DOCTOR\u0014^Glug glug glug! I added rattlesnake venom to this soup. Soon, your head won’t hurt anymore!\u0004\fFEL INFUSED\u0014�Equipped with more advanced gear, the apostles of chaos are said to significantly increase their chances of one-shotting enemies!\u0004\u0011MAGIC APPRENTICE\u0014HMy green robe accidentally got dirty. Do you think this outfit fits me?\u0004\u0010SAVAGE MARAUDER\u0014mFor some reason, many marauders have appeared in the tribe. Innocent travelers are clearly no longer enough.\u0004\rIMMORTAL SUN\u0014GThe sun nurtures all life. Let us pursue the glory of the sun! Roar!!!\u0004\u0014IRON BULL CHIEFTAIN\u0014xWhere iron hooves tread, dust clouds the sun! This legion knows nothing of retreat; their warcry can shatter mountains.\u0004\fDARK PRIEST\u0014TDo their soft whispers offer prayers of redemption, or utter curses of destruction?\u0004\u0013RADIANT CANDLEWISP\u0014�Flickering between candle flame and ice crystal, it lingers with a lantern where day meets night, between melting snow and rising mist.\u0004\u0010IRONCLAD KNIGHT\u0014lWhen they charge, the earth trembles—they are mobile fortresses, living hammers that shatter enemy ranks.\u0004\u000eSPARTAN GUARD\u0014RAs long as the Spartans stand, crimson capes will forever fly across this canyon!\u0004\fORCA HUNTER\u0014�See the fin breaking the surface? It's an omen worse than any storm—the moment the Orca breaches, your mast becomes driftwood.\u0004\fELVEN QUEEN\u0014tThey say High Elves cannot see motionless objects. Those who've tested this theory never returned to tell the tale.\u0004\u0010TEMPLE ASSASSIN\u00142Devoted to the light, yet serving in the shadows.\u0004\u0011DUNGEON DEFENDER\u0014SI used to be an adventurer like you, until I took a dozen arrows all over my body.\u0004\u0015GREEN PEPPER SHOOTER\u00144Once bred in eco-pods, this spicy unit still slaps.\u0004\u0014ANCIENT FROZEN SOUL\u0014:Bound and crowned by eternal frost, they rule in silence.\u0004\u0016IMPERIAL GUARD LEADER\u0014rWhen he unleashes the armored war-turtles, his living fortress slams through enemy lines like a falling red star.\u0004\u000fMITHRIL KNIGHT\u0014\\Moonlight flows like a river between mithril armor patterns, blooming into celestial veins.\u0004\u0016ETERNAL FOREST SPIRIT\u00144This body is an oath, may the forest thrive as one!\u0004\u0010CHINESE PHANTOM\u0014:This outfit radiates with mysterious power from the East.\u0004\u0010SKELETAL HUNTER\u0014NThe bone armor creaks with the spear-throwing motion, a requiem for the prey.\u0004\u000bRONIN MAGE\u0014KBorn of fire, a drifting ember in the world. Bound to a life of solitude. \u0004\u0011PHANTOM ICE MAGE\u0014hHis magic remains powerful, and every wave of his staff flows with icy elegance and chilling precision.\u0004\u000eNAGA VALKYRIE\u0014}A regular Champion of combat tournaments. A master of archery with who also knows a thing or two about hand-to-hand combat. \u0004 GENERAL OF THE FROZEN WASTELAND\u0014BA legendary warrior said to emerge only within raging  blizzards.\u0004\fASTROMANCER\u0014GHarnesses the power of the cosmos to deliver a single, perfect strike.\u0004\rTROJAN HORSE\u0014DYou can't help but feel a little scared when you run into a hacker.\u0004\u0010DEMON PROTOTYPE\u0014VAn artificial Demon Lord created by a mad scientist, equipped with hellforged armor. \u0004\u0014BLACK DRAGON KNIGHT\u0014_Clad in cool black armor and wielding a red crystal spear, a hero straight out of a dark myth.\u0004\u0017SAINT OF THE SNOW LAND\u0014dThe elven saint of the ice and snow kingdom. With every swing of her sword, she summons a blizzard.\u0004\u000eMAD SCIENTIST\u00143The answer is 42! But what was the question again?\u0004\u0011GOLDEN DAWN MOLT\u0014xPast hatred and pain have been reborn as resplendent gold and white. Now, he walks a new path guided by hope and light.\u0004\u0013GOLD-DIGGING DRILL\u0014cCarrying a mechanical device with twin drills on its back, it pulverizes any obstacle in its path.\u0004\u0015BATTLEFIELD CHAMPION\u0014hThe golden belt around his waist proves that both his strength and skill have been honed to perfection.\u0004\u0013PROPHET OF SILENCE\u0014]Beneath his explosive anger rests a silent prophecy that sees beyond the coming destruction.\u0004\u001eDEER SPIRIT OF THE DEEP WOODS\u0014]A deer spirit that flits through the woods, guarding the ancient secrets of the deep forest.\u0004\u0013THE GREAT MAGICIAN\u0014JYohoho! Next, I'm going to pull a coin bigger than a chest out of my hat!\u0004\u0012BLAZE ENCHANTRESS\u0014�An emissary of infernal fire from the demon realm. A mistress of flame whose scorching wrath consumes all who stand before her.\u0004\rMECHA REAPER\u0014�With the speed of its mechanical frame and precision battlefield reconnaissance, this steel reaper weaves through the front lines as the embodiment of death.\u0004\u0011SUNDER BERSERKER\u0014�Veins of light pulse beneath his tribal armor, each heartbeat driving him deeper into battle. A berserker who lives for the chaos of war.\u0004\rVAMPIRE LORD\u0014cThe immortal ruler of the dark bloodline, he commands absolute dominion over the realm of shadows.\u0004\u0014DARKFLAME SOVEREIGN\u0014~From the smoldering depths of the abyss, the Darkflame Sovereign rises. The herald of ruin, his gaze turning kingdoms to ash.\u0004\rSHADOWSHROOM\u0014fThe sun has no place in his world. He moves beneath the night sky, where his venom grows more lethal.\u0004\u0012DEEP-SEA GUARDIAN\u0014CThough Atlantis has sunk, he remains, guarding that sunken palace.\u0004\u0011MOONLIT WEREWOLF\u0014TThe full moon rises, awakening the werewolf’s power. Prepare for a frenzied hunt!\u0004\u0014PENGUIN COAST GUARD\u0014LThe great seas fall under his protection. No criminal escapes his dominion.\u0004\fHEART QUEEN\u00147Before I became a witch, I was the queen of a kingdom.\u0004\u000fDRAGON WARRIOR\u0014�In the ancient East, there is a dragon. Through relentless training and unwavering discipline, his kung fu became unrivaled under the heavens.\u0004\fDEADLY DUET\u0014@Give me a target! My two bullets will strike it simultaneously!\u0004\u0012BLAZING CANNONEER\u0014[Fire! When he shouts “Showtime,” you’d better cover your ears and follow the rhythm.\u0004\u0013ARBITER OF JUSTICE\u0014wWhen the wings spread, an unbreakable realm of law takes shape. The holy sword delivers divine judgment upon all sins.\u0004\u000eECLIPSE ARROW\u0014�When the purple moon hangs high, she transforms into a hunter of the dark night, each arrow capable of piercing the enemy's soul.\u0004!(Acquisition method: Tournament)\u0004\fLAVA CANYON\u0014PIn the distance flows scorching lava, rumored to be detested by Glacial Sprite.\u0004\u000fLOST SNOWFIELD\u0014oA desolate snowfield seldom trodden by humans, where elusive sightings of animated snowmen occasionally occur.\u0004\fTITAN CREST\u0014WThe stone giant loves watching hero battles, though he's not one to pay for admission.\u0004\bOLYMPUS\u0014PThe highest mountain peak in Greece, referring to the twelve most revered gods.\u0004\fLOST FOREST\u0014_Treat the trees here carefully, or else the guarding forest rangers will rain arrows upon you.\u0004\u0010PRIMORDIAL GAZE\u0014mThis battlefield is under the watchful gaze of higher-dimensional beings; let's avoid making too much noise.\u0004\u000eSUNSET DESERT\u00141Beneath the golden sand lie countless treasures.\u0004#THE LAND OF THE NETHERWORLD SWORDS\u0014fThe sharp edge of the sword flickers with a cold murderous intent in the dim light of the underworld.\u0004\u001fSTRANGE SHADOW OF THE WRECKAGE\u00149This ship lacks everything except food. -- DEEPSEA GIANT\u0004\u0012GOLD MINING FIELD\u0014hIn the deep and dangerous mine pit, there are a large number of rich ores that have not been mined yet.\u0004\u0012LAVA BATTLEGROUND\u00144Lava surges and flows, reflecting the jagged rocks.\u0004\u0013TOURNAMENT GROUNDS\u0014XAn ancient, colossal open-air arena that has witnessed the rise of countless champions.\u0004\tATLANTIS\u0014�Deep within the submerged city of Atlantis, a giant statue of the sea god stands holding a trident, guarding the forgotten city.\u0004\rEMERALD PATH\u0014pAn ancient arena wrapped in green vines, where glowing minerals and a mysterious altar pulse with endless life.\u0004\u0014LUMINOUS MOON ALYAR\u0014RGunsmoke swirls among the ruins as the altar crumbles under the full moon's gaze.\u0004\u0011DEMONBANE FIELDS\u0014�The air is thick with the scent of magic. In the distance, a mysterious runic circle faintly appears, seemingly hiding an evil power capable of overthrowing everything.\u0004\u001bFORBIDDEN ALTAR OF SECRETS\u0014NA shrine shrouded in shadow and miasmic fog, whispering with forbidden power.\u0004\u000fANCIENT DRAGON\u0014sAn abyssal dragon sovereign, enthroned within a rift in spacetime, guarding an ancient seal with divine authority.\u0004\rDRAKE'S SEEP\u0014mIn the abyssal violet mists, the dragon's skeleton lies in eternal slumber, where mystery and peril coexist.\u0004\u0013ECLIPSE RUNE ARRAY\u0014�At every eclipse, the array’s eye glows in ghostly blue, luring all who enter toward the endless void. Most are never seen again.\u0004\u0010BLAZING BARRAGE\u0014.Use fireworks cautiously in prohibited areas.\u0004\rGALAXY STARS\u0014DThe enemies I defeat are as numerous as the stars in the night sky.\u0004\rLUCKY CLOVER\u00148Represents true love, health, reputation and happiness.\u0004\rVICTORY FLAG\u0014DThe red flag flutters, like the dawn of victory, dazzlingly bright.\u0004\u0015WARM SUN AND RAINBOW\u0014SThe warm sun is hanging high in the sky, and the rainbow stretches across the sky.\u0004\u0010MOON'S RADIANCE\u0014�The cold osmanthus trees and the cold moon gaze at each other from afar, and a chilly and desolate atmosphere pervades the air.\u0004\u000eRADIANT LOTUS\u0014JAs the petals unfold, a faint light flows through the translucent petals.\u0004\u0017SONG OF THE STAR WHALE\u0014�Halos condense within ripples into swirling stardust, as the whale's call becomes an ethereal echo fading into the boundless starlight.\u0004\u0014BLAZING METEOR SOAR\u0014PA blazing phoenix scream splits the sky, scorching everything with golden fire.\u0004\u0011CITY-WIDE BOUNTY\u0014RYou are forbidden from increasing your Influence by putting a bounty on yourself.\u0004\u0019PUMPKIN CROWN OF TRIUMPH\u0014�As the horn of victory echoes, those piercing eyes and jagged grin ignite the shadows, like haunting emblems of Halloween night.\u0004\u000fChicken Dinner\u0014�At the moment of victory, dawn breaks over the farm. A rooster crows, its call echoing across the fields — a herald of the feast to come.\u0004\u001aDIMENSION-SHATTERING GAZE\u0014�When the crimson demonic eye slowly opens, the fabric of space fractures beneath its gaze. With a single glance, it tears dimensions apart and crushes all resistance.\u0004\u0014Crystalline Triumph\u0014�As the final blow lands, brilliant crystal light bursts from the void. A diamond-like glow surrounds you, carving the glory of victory into the magic circle. Every stream of light declares: In this battle, you have been crowned king.\u0004\u000eSHINING DEBUT\u0014YThe lights are flashing, so it's recommended to close your eyes upon entering the stage.\u0004\u0010FLORAL SPLENDOR\u0014KIt is said that the petals are fragrant, earning high praise among heroes.\u0004\u0013DESTRUCTIVE IMPACT\u0004#Ashes to ashes, weaklings, begone!\u0004\u001bTHE GATE OF EMERALD SHADOW\u0014EThese vines are trained. Probably they won't entangle heroes. Maybe.\u0004\u0014FROST FILLS THE SKY\u0014cThe pure white ice crystals are swirling between heaven and earth, like a dream, seeming illusory.\u0004\u000fWINGS OF CHAOS\u0014HThe black wings stretch out in the chaos, enveloping endless mysteries.\u0004\u0015FLOWING WATER IMPACT\u0014@Gathering surging water, the splashes explode and surge wildly.\u0004\u001aDIVINE THUNDER'S JUDGMENT\u0014kA pillar of lightning, charged with divine retribution, pierces the stage as crackling arcs surge skyward.\u0004\u0012FOREST'S BLESSING\u0014?A protective barrier of intertwining vines and floral shadows.\u0004\u000fVOICE OF MUSIC\u0014RThe stars compose the melody. Falling, echoing, and setting all things in motion.\u0004\u000fAZURE JUDGMENT\u0014}Above the clear sky, a greatsword of pure energy splits the vortex of clouds, crashing to the ground like a divine judgment.\u0004\u0018SCORPIO’S ASTRAL RISE\u0014tBorn of the cerulean nebula, Scorpio’s phantom tears through the void, wielding the fury of the stars themselves.\u0004\u0017Fairytale Snow Cottage\u0014�A dream cottage adrift in a winter’s tale, with glistening icicles draping from its eaves and pine boughs cradling fluffy snow.\u0004\u0015Stellar Ring Descent\u0014�Star rings spiral down from the void, light bands surging like a galaxy. The central eye shoots a dazzling pillar of light. Every stream of light carries the edge of falling stars, announcing your arrival.\u0004\fBLADE CHIEF\u0004\u0012KERFUFFLE APOSTLE\u0004\u000eTIGER SHOOTER\u0004\u0010BULL HEAD CHIEF\u0004\u0013CHILLLIGHT PROPHET\u0004\u0011PENGUIN CAPTAIN \u0004\u0012BLOODSHED MONARCH\u0004\u000fPEPPER SHOOTER\u0004\fWOLF HUNTER\u0004\u000fTRIBAL WARSOUL\u0004\fLORD STINGY\u0004\u001dCERTIFICATE OF INTERNAL TEST\u0004!DEMON SHADOW-DARKFLAME SOVEREIGN\u0004\rRANK TOP 100\u0004\fRANK TOP 10\u0004\nRANK NO.1\u0004\u0019TOP 100 OF the WINS LIST\u0004\u0018TOP 10 OF the WINS LIST\u0004\u0016NO.1 OF THE WINS LIST\u0004\u0016OUTWOLRD HONEY BADGER\u0004\rWORLD WEAVER\u0004\u0017Tournament FIRST PLACE\u0004\u0018Tournament SECOND PLACE\u0004\u0017Tournament THIRD PLACE\u00147(Acquisition route: Exclusive to the closed beta test)\u0014RThis honey badger from another world  seems to be passionate about making videos.\u0014\\Awarded to the outstanding contributors who build bridges and connect worlds with language.\u0004\u000fINFINITY CHEST\u0014�\u001e\u0001\u0000\u0000After opening, randomly obtain the following items:\nTAROT*10: 1.25%    TAROT*4: 5%\nTAROT*2: 31.25%\n\nROYALE CRYSTAL*100: 1.25%\nROYALE CRYSTAL*30: 5% \nROYALE CRYSTAL*15: 31.25%\n\nCOLLECTION SHARD*30: 1.25% \nCOLLECTION SHARD*15: 5%\nCOLLECTION SHARD*10: 6.25%\n\nFlowers*5: 5%\nFlowers*3: 7.5%\u0014HIt is used to unlock the premium reward channel in the Season Handbook.\u0004\u0018Claim Tarot cards daily\u0004\rMONTHLY PACK\u0014-Contains Tarot *100 and Royale Crystal *1000\u0004\fDAILY BONUS\u0004\u0011MONTH CARD BONUS\u0004\u001bClaim Tarot cards *6 daily\u0004\nGOOD LUCK\u0004\u000bTAROT PACK\u0004\rCRYSTAL PACK\u0004\rDIAMOND PACK\u0004\u000eCRYSTAL CHEST\u0004\u000bGood luck!\u0014��\u0001\u0000\u00001. Crystal Chests open automatically when obtained. Items received from crystal chests can be viewed in the COLLECTION menu.\n2. The probability for a single chest opening is as follows:\n{0}\n3. If you obtain a duplicate collectible, it will be converted into [{1}] according to its rarity (usable to exchange for collectibles in the COLLECTION system). The conversion rates are as follows:\n{2}\u0004\u0006BASIC\u0004\tTUTORIAL\u0004\u001f<color=#fcca00>[SKILL]</color>\u0014�U\u0002\u0000\u0000Skills are divided into <color=#8f93a8>Common Skills</color>, <color=#417fff>Rare Skills</color>, and <color=#fcca00>Mythic Skills</color>.\nWhen learning, they respectively increase 1/2/3 Branch EXP.\n<color=#417fff>Rare Skills</color> start to appear when the affiliated branch reaches 1 star, and will definitely appear when it reaches 2 stars. <color=#fcca00>Legendary Skills</color> start to appear when the branch reaches 3 stars. If there are still some left in the store, they will definitely appear when it reaches 4 stars.\nSkills grant significant bonuses when reaching the highest level.\u0004%<color=#fcca00>[BRANCH STAR]</color>\u0014�Each skill belongs to 1-2 specific branches.\nLearning a skill increases the branch's star level and grants branch-specific effects.\nWhen a branch reaches the max level, it provides substantial bonuses.\u0004$<color=#fcca00>[HERO LEVEL]</color>\u0014�When a branch stars up, the hero's level increases synchronously.\nWhen a hero levels up, gains <color=#ff9e39>Max HP</color> additionally.\u0004\u001f<color=#fcca00>[STATS]</color>\u0014��\u0001\u0000\u0000<color=#627eec>Dodge</color> and <color=#ff2429>CRIT</color> are capped at 75 each in battle.\nThe default damage multiplier for <color=#ff2429>Critical Attacks</color> is 200%.\nIn addition to basic and skill-based Energy Regen, losing a certain percentage of <color=#ff9e39>HP</color> grants a specific amount of <color=#60ffc9>Energy</color>.\nWhen stunned, Base Attacks, Dodge, and Ultimate skills cannot be used.\u0004\"<color=#fcca00>[DMG TYPE]</color>\u0014�0\u0003\u0000\u0000<color=#7d7d7d>[Phys.DMG]</color>\nHero <color=#7d7d7d>Base Attacks</color> are considered <color=#7d7d7d>Physical DMG</color> by default and are influenced by <color=#ff2429>CRIT</color> and <color=#627eec>Dodge</color>.\n<color=#992bfe>[Mag.DMG]</color>\nUsually associated with the <color=#60ffc9>Ultimates</color> or skills, and by default cannot <color=#ff2429>crit</color> or be <color=#627eec>dodged</color>.\n<color=#128609>[Poison DMG]</color>\nDamage based on the <color=#128609>number of Poison stacks</color>, and by default cannot <color=#ff2429>crit</color> or be <color=#627eec>dodged</color>.\n<color=#e2a600>[Holy DMG]</color>\nUnaffected by all bonuses except Battle Speedup, cannot be <color=#627eec>dodged</color>, blocked by <color=#775b46>Shields</color>, or shared by <color=#ff91d2>Sprites</color>.\u0004(<color=#fcca00>[BRANCH DETAILS]</color>\u0014��\u0001\u0000\u0000<color=#eebc15>HEAL</color>: <color=#eebc15>Healing</color> effects do not trigger when at full HP.\n<color=#775b46>SHIELD</color>: Each Shield stack blocks 1 damage when taking damage and counteracts <color=#674d7d>Wound</color>.\n<color=#674d7d>WOUND</color>: Each Wound stack increases damage taken by 1 and counteracts <color=#775b46>Shield</color>.\n<color=#ff91d2>SPRITE</color>: Summons Sprites on the battlefield. Click a Sprite to view its HP and DMG Share. Multiple Sprites share damage collectively.\u0004(<color=#fcca00>[MATCH SETTINGS]</color>\u0014��\u0001\u0000\u0000For each match, 8 branches are randomly selected, while others are banned.\nThe skill pool is shared, and each skill has a limited total number. When a player is eliminated, some of their learned skills return to the store.\nWhen the star level conditions are met, players can learn <color=#417fff>Rare Skills</color> and <color=#fcca00>Mythic Skills</color> from the random skill pool.\nIf a battle lasts too long, it will be accelerated, increasing all damage on the field.\u0004$<color=#fcca00>[PLAYER DMG]</color>\u0014�Players start with a default damage of 1. Winning a battle increases damage, while losing decreases damage.\nDamage has upper and lower limits that gradually increase with each round.\u0004 <color=#fcca00>[MIRROR]</color>\u0014�When there is an odd number of players on the field, a random player is copied as a mirror image.\nDefeating the copy does not harm the original player.\u0014[In battles, Click on a player to view statistics.\n Click on any stat to see detailed data.\u0004%<color=#fcca00>[GOLD INCOME]</color>\u0014�J\u0002\u0000\u0000In battle, Gold is used to purchase skills.\n<color=orange>Base Income:</color> Automatically gain 300-400 Gold each round. This amount increases as rounds progress.\n<color=orange>Interest:</color> For every 100 Gold you have at the end of a round, gain 10 bonus Gold in the next round, up to a maximum of 50.\n<color=orange>Victory:</color> Gain 50 Gold for winning a battle.\n<color=orange>Win Streak:</color> Gain an extra 10 Gold for each consecutive win, up to a maximum of 30.\n<color=orange>Loss Compensation:</color> Gain 30 Gold for each point of Player Life you lose to an enemy.\u0004\u0004PRO\u0004\u0002/\u0004\b BRANCH\u0014SEasy to build. With the Freeze branch banned this round, this can be a top choice.\u0014HQuickly deal Base Attack DMG by leveraging the effects of branch stars.\u0014_Freeze slows ATK SPD, and Dodge growth is difficult. Consider it when Freeze is not available.\u0014XPrioritize upgrading Dodge for survival and damage output. Not recommended for rookies.\u0014XMagical Dodge+High Dodge Value, can evade almost all damage except Poison and Holy DMG.\u0014-Agility Shackles and Poison DMG can counter.\u0014gInitially, all Phys.DMG can critically hit, with additional advanced magic burst strategies available.\u0014NThe key is to improve CRIT, and increase Phys.DMG frequency for burst damage.\u0014\\Besides CRIT Defense, observe opponent damage output composition to strategize effectively.\u0014VHP-triggered linkage is the most stable; focus on increasing hero HP in later stages.\u0014CPrioritize Max HP, rely on HP Strike, Poison, etc, to deal damage.\u0004'HP Steal is very effective against HP.\u0014eNot recommended for rookies as the main branch, with better recovery effects in the first 10 rounds.\u0014cIncrease recovery amount and trigger frequency; early natural healing has high cost-effectiveness.\u0014IHealing Disruption significantly reduces the opponent's recovery amount.\u0014-Choose when there is no HP or Shield branch.\u0014jQuick Energy recovery for high-frequency Ultimate casts, and it is also essential to take the initiative.\u0014|Reduce the opponent's Energy recovery, enhance self HP branch stars, and Pre-battle Shield prevents being instantly killed.\u0014QA strong branch, with many skills poison-linked, can try Poison+Freeze branches.\u0014TIncrease Poison stacks and single-poison damage, with the latter being prioritized.\u0014cExcept for Poison Antidote, observe the opponent's poison stacking and coordination to counteract.\u0014>Top choice for Mag.DMG, performs brilliantly with Magic Crit.\u0014\\Trigger Freeze DMG to deal damage, and trigger skills are not necessarily at the max level.\u0014iFreeze Antidote reduces Freeze stacks, and you should pay attention to the opponent's triggering method.\u0014YShield Smash is the core, increasing the shield trigger, with Crit Boost as the support.\u0014ZTry to max out Shield Smash, and get all shield skills, not necessarily at the max level.\u0014LShield Disruption; Dodge Boost; Base ATK branch can quickly consume stacks.\u0014bA support and damage boost branch, can be the main branch when HP and Shield branches are banned.\u0014BShields directly negate Wound, Wound Immunity reduces stack count\u0014`Shield directly neutralizes Wound, and Wound Immunity does not take effect to Pre-battle Wound.\u0014UA damage-taken branch, can be a support survival method even not as the main branch.\u0014fPrioritize Sprite Contract, Twin Sprites, Sprite Marble, or stacking buffs as the main damage output.\u0014UAs long as the opponent's Sprites are destroyed, the opponent is basically defeated.\u00149Fury significantly increases damage during its duration.\u0014IAccumulate more Rage, ensure long Fury and pursue higher damage bonuses.\u0014~Reduce the opponent's efficiency of accumulating Rage, avoid high frequency and low damage output method as much as possible.\u0014+Reduces the cooldown of periodic abilities\u0014�Learn as many periodic abilities as you can and shorten their cooldowns to quickly trigger CHARGED MISSILE. Use CYCLE LOOP to unleash multiple CRESCENT SACRED MARKs.\u0014HUse Freeze to counter Haste. Haste Decay slows down Haste accumulation.\u00147Click on the sprites in the scene to view their health\u0014�There are shortcut keys in the game. When the mouse hovers over them,buttons will be displayed. They can also be turned off in the settings\u0014�Do you want to relearn the newbie tutorial? Click on the guide button on the main interface. There are also unique branch strategies and tips\u0014oSome treasures will not appear in all stages. You can switch stages from the illustrated handbook to view them\u0014ZAfter the relevant branch is banned by the authority, related heroes will not be spawned.\u0014VDo you want to quickly understand the situation? Try pressing the Tab key in the game\u00144The ESC key can close most of the pop-up interfaces\u0014kWhat to do when encountering a player who makes inappropriate remarks? Click on his avatar and report him!\u0014pThe number in the sword next to the avatar in the game represents the damage caused to the player after victory\u0014�The redemption code is entered in the settings in the upper right corner of the main interface. Joining the official community can obtain the latest redemption codes\u0014?Poisoning cannot be dodged and does not belong to magic damage\u0014-Only 8 skill branch will appear in each game\u0014QEveryone was once a novice. Please be kind to new players who are eager to learn\u0014FDo you know? You can view information by clicking on heroes in battle\u00146Some treasures need to be clicked to be used actively\u00147By default,Dodge and Crit only work on physical damage\u0014_Do you want to bring along three or seven friends to play 【Skill Legends Royale】 together?\u0014:It is said that team games will have an extra point bonus\u0014HThe skill pool is shared, and th